  "The Storage status line in Settings → Storage now reports the resolved path of the `data.json` metadata is actually written to, alongside the existing shard folder. When metadata is stored in a vault folder, the `data.json` inside the plugin folder is reduced to a small pointer and the real file lives in the vault — which made \"where did my data go\" hard to answer after switching storage modes, particularly when reverting to Legacy JSON.",
